From 3ea3984be4ba3d1578a61b996b1ee817ef433510 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil <irons7654321@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 10:21:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] avformat: scope headers and preserve HTTPS transport

---
